  "description": "Hotspots (threshold -50, radius 3, min weight 4): low tracts (10,10), (11,10), (10,12), (20,20), (9,11) merge with trunc((h x w + x) / (w + 1)) into (9, 10, 4); (20, 20, 1) is removed. Riot: one double draw per cycle (roll = f32(0 + u x 100)), plus one integer draw over the hotspot count only when a hotspot exists and the riot curve exists; chance curve(4) = 8 > roll 7.5 -> AttemptDisasterStart on manager 0xCA380B06 at (9 x 4 + 2, 10 x 4 + 2) = (38, 42); roll 8.0 -> nothing; the integer draw picks the hotspot (k = 1 -> weight 5, curve 10 > 9 -> riot; k = 0 -> weight 4, 8 < 9 -> none); without the riot curve no integer draw. Radius 2 / min weight 1 gives the hand-merged list. Scripted generator; hand-derived (Python check).",
  "steps": [
